      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "71 Old County Glen, Crumlin, Dublin 12\r\n\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents, your local property experts, are delighted to present to the market no.71 Old County Glen. This fine 3 bedroom home nestled in the heart of Crumlin is bound to catch the eye of any discerning purchaser.\r\n\r\nThis property is surrounded by a host of local amenities to include shops, cafes and restaurants, parks and sports facilities, with Lourdes Celtic Football Club just around the corner. You are also within close proximity to areas such as Rialto and Sundrive.\r\n\r\nWalking through the front door you are met with a feeling of warmth and home. Plenty of natural light floods in through the windows in the sitting room to the front, moving down the hallway you enter the modern kitchen/dining area. This space is fully equipped and, paired with the sliding patio doors out to the garden, would make a great entertaining space or simply a space to spend valuable family time. A small under the stairs toilet completes the ground floor.\r\n\r\nTo the rear of the property you have a private and sunny back garden. This garden would need practically little to no maintenance, which takes a load off your shoulders.\r\n\r\nUpstairs briefly comprises three bedrooms, a double to the rear complete with an ensuite,and a double alongside a single bedroom to the front aspect. A modern and fully tiled family bathroom completes the first floor.\r\n\r\nNumber 71 benefits from great public transport links with several bus routes running throughout the area. The M50 motorway is also only a short drive away which opens up access to the Greater Dublin Area and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nInterest in this fantastic property will be very high so early viewing would be recommended.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Off street parking\r\n- Prime location\r\n- Beautiful condition\r\n- Local amenities\r\n- Three bedrooms"
      },
